              <h2>PROJECT BRIEF</h2>
              <p>This was a Unity Global Game Jam entry. The theme of the jam was: Roots.</p>
              
              <h2>CONCEPT & THEME</h2>
              <p>A game about making roots! Like Pile Up!, game jam games are best when they're quick & compulsive.</p>

              <h2>ROLES</h2>
              <ul>
                <li>Game Designer</li>
                <li>Art</li>
                <li>Music</li>

              </ul>
              <div>
                <h2>Design Goals</h2>
                <ul>
                  <li>Easy to Replay</li>
                  <li>Easy to Understand</li>
                  <li>Micro-SCOPE-ic (theme emerges!)</li>
                </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
              <div class="hero desktop">
                
              <a href="https://cyboi.itch.io/sproots" target="_blank"> <img src="/content/images/portfolio/sproots/sproots-banner.png"></a>
                <h3>**NOTES**</h3>
                This was my first game in a game engine! <br>
                The system we used to generate droplets is unoptimized and means the game loads very slowly. Please be patient!<br>
                Watch your ears! The music is a bit loud 🥶<br>
              </div>
                
