          <div class=bot-fold>            
            <div>
              <h2>Challenges</h2>
              <ul>
                <li>What's the best system to achieve the desired feel?</li>
                <li>What's the desired feel? Chill, anxious?</li>
                <li>Balancing your goals vs your teammate vs the various constraints in game dev</li>
              </ul>    
            </div>          

            <div>
              <h2>Outcomes</h2>
              <ul>
                <li>The systems we settled on lead to must-lose situations & pointless clicking</li>
                <li>We managed to finish the game, but were unable to optimize art, music and systems</li>
                <li>The camera was disorienting for some people</li>
              </ul> 
            </div>

            <div>
              <h2>LEARNINGS</h2>
              <ul>
                <li>Prototype quick to find problems early!</li>
                <li>Don't sit on your hands. Keep talking and making, even if it's not your strong suit - it has to get done!</li>
                <li>What feels right to you may not feel right to your players. (PLAYTEST MORE!)</li>
              </ul> 
            </div>

